cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the released data, please cite the paper listed under preferred-citation."
title: "Antarctic-Cloud-Detection: AGCNet for Antarctic ground-based all-sky cloud segmentation and classification"
abstract: >-
  Official project page for AGCNet, a Solar Position Prior-guided progressive
  refinement network for joint cloud segmentation and cloud-type classification
  in Antarctic ground-based all-sky imagery. The associated dataset and derived
  cloud product for Zhongshan Station, East Antarctica, are deposited on Zenodo.
